flowchart TD
    A[Open purchase form] --> B[Select supplier]
    B --> C[AJAX: get categories]
    C --> D[Select category]
    D --> E[AJAX: get products]
    E --> F[Add one or more purchase lines]
    F --> G[Client calculates buying price and total]
    G --> H[POST purchase/store]
    H --> I[(Purchase status = 0)]
    I --> J[Pending purchase list]
    J --> K{Approve purchase?}
    K -- No --> J
    K -- Yes --> L[Product quantity increases]
    L --> M[(Purchase status = 1)]
    M --> N[Approved purchase reports and stock totals]
